Tome Francisco - 71210


Vertex Shader inputs:
- u_site_position - the positions of all existing sites
- u_site_color - the color of all existing sites
- u_n_sites - the current number of existing sites
- u_metric - the current distance metric used
- u_is_depth - if the depth algorithm is currently in use
- u_viewport_width - the width of the viewport
- u_viewport_height - the height of the viewport
- a_position - the position of the current vertex

Vertex Shader outputs:
- v_color - the color of the fragment during is_depth

Fragment Shader inputs:
- u_site_position - the positions of all existing sites
- u_site_color - the color of all existing sites
- u_n_sites - the current number of existing sites
- u_metric - the current distance metric used
- u_border_delta - the value used to calculate the size of the border
- u_is_depth - if the depth algorithm is currently in use
- v_color - the color of the current fragment during is_depth

Fragment Shader outputs:
- color - the final color of the current fragment
